nt32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"此时形势，黑挺3卒迫兑，败着，被红方借势兑子，形成攻虚之势，仍应走马8进7，以求坚持。以下红以简洁明快的兑子取势结果，出乎黑的预料。","text":"此时形势，黑挺3卒迫兑，败着，被红方借势兑子，形成攻虚之势，仍应走马8进7，以求坚持。以下红以简洁明快的兑子取势结果，出乎黑的预料。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment36","raw_text":"黑如炮8平3去马，则炮五进四，士4进5，车一平六绝杀。","text":"黑如炮8平3去马，则炮五进四，士4进5，车一平六绝杀。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"0:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":"红趁势沉炮底线，攻势凶狠，黑已难以应付。","text":"红趁势沉炮底线，攻势凶狠，黑已难以应付。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"红胜。||黑以士去车速败，但如改走炮8平4，亦不过苟延残喘，多熬时日罢了，以下红车六平八无解，黑认负。||短评：黑中局连连误着，并有致命疏忽，被红趁势而下。","text":"红胜。\n黑以士去车速败，但如改走炮8平4，亦不过苟延残喘，多熬时日罢了，以下红车六平八无解，黑认负。\n短评：黑中局连连误着，并有致命疏忽，被红趁势而下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["辽宁卜凤波 先胜 广西冯明光"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_result":["红胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["中炮巡河炮对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":16,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":48,"legal_move_records":48,"annotations":7,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":7}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类 辽宁卜凤波 先胜 广西冯明光","catalogue_order":32,"directory_url":"